# inc-w91w rule 2: fire at a found trap under a creature, three squares
# east. `t` opens target mode, RIGHT steps to the creature, ENTER opens the
# "-- Examine --" list of the square (creature, trap, terrain...), and the
# trap is picked from it by name. Same `s` and lowercase-f notes as
# trap-shot-loc.keys.
@while "-- more --" SPACE
s
f
t
RIGHT
ENTER
@expect "-- Examine --"
@dump:pick-list
@choose "light trap"
@while "Really fire" y
@while "-- more --" SPACE
@dump:shot-after
@quit
